From fca519a6b9fdb854b7a577a49e4686606fcdc987 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: klarnet2009 <185848556+klarnet2009@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:17:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] arm64: dts: qcom: add Samsung Galaxy Tab Active Pro
 (SM-T545) board and sdm670 changes

Board DTS for the SM-T545 (sdm670-samsung-gtactivexl) with the t545-*.dtsi fragments (eMMC, memory map, USB/OTG, headset and mic routing, Venus, protected GCC clocks, initrd) and the sdm670.dtsi additions it needs. The Samsung bootloader only accepts a boot image that carries the stock DTB, so the stage-1 stub in this project replaces it at boot.
---
