+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
+ * Bring-up step 0: everything in the SoC except the interrupt controller is off, so that no driver can touch
+ * hardware that Samsung's firmware keeps gated or protected. Nodes are switched back on one at a time.
+ */
